823856dd7c3cef45bea2681828526d1b9f8\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">6a1d682</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">SQL queries in online_userlist.php to use MAX() for session data and adjusted GROUP BY clause for better accuracy (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1971\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1971</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/2a8b6daecf63752b8a852c950e9a7fd08e17f57c\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">2a8b6da</a>)</li>\n</ul><h3 class=\"bbHeading\"><a class=\"u-anchorTarget\" name=\"-gear-miscellaneous\"></a>⚙️ Miscellaneous&#8203;<a class=\"hoverLink\" href=\"#-gear-miscellaneous\" title=\"Permanent link\"></a></h3><ul>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\"><i>(cliff)</i> Add conventional commit prefix to changelog message (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1970\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1970</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/7d9594eedab1b2c81d888dfba68ded1b8a142282\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">7d9594e</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Changed active branch name in _release.php (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1972\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1972</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/7dc69ba699c75d87c709a799291c4b544b3e92aa\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">7dc69ba</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Changed branch name from master to v2.4 (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1968\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1968</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torren